BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ummi-20260407@ummi.local
DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260407
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260408
SUMMARY:Your prenatal vitamins
DESCRIPTION:Keep these going through pregnancy and after delivery.\n\nAlso 
 today:\n• Adhān and iqāmah before every prayer (With your hand on your
  stomach.)\n• Sūrah al-Qadr (97) over two dates (Recite once\, blow on 
 the dates\, eat them on an empty stomach.)\n• An apple in the morning\n
 • A pinch of Khāke Shifāʾ before sunset (Turbah of Karbalāʾ\, also 
 called Turbah Imām Ḥusayn.)\n• Vitamin D (Milk\, orange juice and egg
  yolks are good sources.)\n\nWeek 4\, month 1 of the guide.
CATEGORIES:Wellness
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
