BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ummi-20260609@ummi.local
DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260609
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260610
SUMMARY:Istighfār 7 times
DESCRIPTION:Astaghfirullāha Rabbī wa atūbu ilayh.\n\nAlso today:\n• S
 ūrah al-Furqān 25:74 (The prayer for comfort in your family.)\n• Ṣal
 awāt 140 times after each prayer\n• Ṣalātul Layl (As much as you can
  manage. If you miss the time\, make it up later as qaḍāʾ.)\n• Sūra
 h al-Qadr (97) in one rakʿah of every prayer\n• After the daily prayers
 : al-Kawthar\, al-Qadr\, long ṣalawāt (Sūrah al-Kawthar (108)\, Sūrah
  al-Qadr (97)\, then the long ṣalawāt with your hand on your stomach.)\
 n• Sūrah at-Tīn (95) over two figs (Eat them on an empty stomach.)\n
 • Apples\, honey and pomegranates\n• Nutrient-rich foods (Granola\, cr
 ackers\, lentils\, cheese and leafy greens.)\n\nWeek 13\, month 4 of the g
 uide.
CATEGORIES:Recitation
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
