 e. If you miss the time\, make it up later as qaḍāʾ.)\n• Sūrah al-Q
 adr (97) in one rakʿah of every prayer\n• After the daily prayers: al-K
 awthar\, al-Qadr\, long ṣalawāt (Sūrah al-Kawthar (108)\, Sūrah al-Qa
 dr (97)\, then the long ṣalawāt with your hand on your stomach.)\n• S
