DESCRIPTION:\nAlso today:\n• Rub Khāke Shifāʾ on your stomach (From th
 e start of the fifth month. Turbah from Karbalāʾ.)\n• Adhān and iqām
 ah at ṣalāh time (With your hand on your stomach.)\n• Sūrah al-Fāti
 ḥah (1) over an egg (Then eat it on an empty stomach.)\n• A date every
  morning\n• Nuts (Good fats and vitamin E\, and possibly a lower risk of
  nut allergy in babies.)\n\nWeek 20\, month 5 of the guide.
CATEGORIES:Sūrah
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
