BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ummi-20260901@ummi.local
DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260902
SUMMARY:Ṣalawāt 140 times
DESCRIPTION:\nAlso today:\n• Sūrah al-Mulk (67) and Sūrah an-Nūr (24) 
 (Often\, from this month onward.)\n• The five sūrahs after your prayers
  (After the daily prayers and the tasbīḥ of Sayyidah Fāṭimah (as): a
 l-Ḥashr (59)\, aṣ-Ṣaff (61)\, al-Jumuʿah (62)\, at-Taghābun (64) a
 nd al-Qadr (97).)\n• Sūrah al-Ikhlāṣ (112) in the daily prayers\n•
  Sūrah Yāsīn (36) over almonds (Then eat them on an empty stomach.)\n
 • Melon after your food (No water just before or after it. Watermelon an
 d kharbozeh are named in particular. Mustadrak al-Wasāʾil\, Vol. 3\, p.6
 35.)\n• Iron-rich foods (Spinach\, chickpeas and beef. Baby draws on you
 r iron\, so ask your doctor about supplements too.)\n\nWeek 25\, month 7 o
 f the guide.
CATEGORIES:Recitation
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ummi-20260902@ummi.local
DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260902
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260903
SUMMARY:Sūrah al-Mulk (67) and Sūrah an-Nūr (24)
DESCRIPTION:Often\, from this month onward.\n\nAlso today:\n• Ṣalawāt 
 140 times\n• The five sūrahs after your prayers (After the daily prayer
 s and the tasbīḥ of Sayyidah Fāṭimah (as): al-Ḥashr (59)\, aṣ-
 Ṣaff (61)\, al-Jumuʿah (62)\, at-Taghābun (64) and al-Qadr (97).)\n•
  Sūrah al-Ikhlāṣ (112) in the daily prayers\n• Sūrah Yāsīn (36) o
 ver almonds (Then eat them on an empty stomach.)\n• Melon after your foo
 d (No water just before or after it. Watermelon and kharbozeh are named in
  particular. Mustadrak al-Wasāʾil\, Vol. 3\, p.635.)\n• Iron-rich food
 s (Spinach\, chickpeas and beef. Baby draws on your iron\, so ask your doc
 tor about supplements too.)\n\nWeek 25\, month 7 of the guide.
CATEGORIES:Sūrah
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
