DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261027
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261028
SUMMARY:Sūrah al-Insān (76) over dates and milk
DESCRIPTION:Then take them on an empty stomach.\n\nAlso today:\n• Ṣalaw
 āt 140 times (Allāhumma ṣalli ʿalā Muḥammadin wa Āl Muḥammad.)\
 n• Istighfār 70 times after each prayer (Astaghfirullāha Rabbī wa at
 ūbu ilayh.)\n• Sūrah al-ʿAṣr (103) and adh-Dhāriyāt (51) (In the 
 Ẓuhr and ʿAṣr prayers.)\n• Dates and kebabs (“In the month in whi
 ch pregnant ladies will give birth\, feed them dates so that their childre
 n can be forbearing and virtuous.” Mustadrak al-Wasāʾil\, Vol. 3\, p.1
 12.)\n• A daily walk\n\nWeek 33\, month 9 of the guide.
CATEGORIES:Sūrah
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ummi-20261028@ummi.local
DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261028
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261029
SUMMARY:Dates and kebabs
DESCRIPTION:“In the month in which pregnant ladies will give birth\, feed
  them dates so that their children can be forbearing and virtuous.” Must
 adrak al-Wasāʾil\, Vol. 3\, p.112.\n\nAlso today:\n• Ṣalawāt 140 ti
 mes (Allāhumma ṣalli ʿalā Muḥammadin wa Āl Muḥammad.)\n• Istig
 hfār 70 times after each prayer (Astaghfirullāha Rabbī wa atūbu ilayh.
 )\n• Sūrah al-ʿAṣr (103) and adh-Dhāriyāt (51) (In the Ẓuhr and 
 ʿAṣr prayers.)\n• Sūrah al-Insān (76) over dates and milk (Then tak
 e them on an empty stomach.)\n• A daily walk\n\nWeek 33\, month 9 of the
  guide.
CATEGORIES:Food
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
